      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i feel like even the \"pros\" don't really hold up when you look at how people actually live now. like, the idea of protecting small states sounds like a weak excuse to keep things unfair. do you think there's any actual legitimate way to defend it, or is it just a way for certain groups to keep power they don't deserve?",
